      "widgets_values": [
        "Color Matcher: stats vs histogram.\n\nstats (default) moves the average and spread of each LAB channel — gentle and robust. histogram matches the whole distribution (every tone level), so contrast shape and split-toning carry over more faithfully; it can also exaggerate noise on very different images. Both work in Color Matcher Region too."
